        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 60,
                    "num_str": "60",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All the temple servants and the sons of Solomon’s servants were three hundred and ninety-two."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 61,
                    "num_str": "61",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The following were those who came up from Tel-me′lah, Tel-har′sha, Cherub, Addon, and Immer, but they could not prove their fathers’ houses nor their descent, whether they belonged to Israel: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 62,
                    "num_str": "62",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the sons of Delai′ah, the sons of Tobi′ah, the sons of Neko′da, six hundred and forty-two. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 63,
                    "num_str": "63",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Also, of the priests: the sons of Hobai′ah, the sons of Hakkoz, the sons of Barzil′lai (who had taken a wife of the daughters of Barzil′lai the Gileadite and was called by their name). "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 64,
                    "num_str": "64",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These sought their registration among those enrolled in the genealogies, but it was not found there, so they were excluded from the priesthood as unclean; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 65,
                    "num_str": "65",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "the governor told them that they were not to partake of the most holy food, until a priest with Urim and Thummim should arise."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 66,
                    "num_str": "66",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The whole assembly together was forty-two thousand three hundred and sixty, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 67,
                    "num_str": "67",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "besides their menservants and maidservants, of whom there were seven thousand three hundred and thirty-seven; and they had two hundred and forty-five singers, male and female. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 68,
                    "num_str": "68",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Their horses were seven hundred and thirty-six, their mules two hundred and forty-five,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Ezra 2.66 and the margins of some Hebrew Mss: Heb lacks their horses . . . forty-five"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 69,
                    "num_str": "69",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "their camels four hundred and thirty-five, and their asses six thousand seven hundred and twenty."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 70,
                    "num_str": "70",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now some of the heads of fathers’ houses gave to the work. The governor gave to the treasury a thousand darics of gold, fifty basins, five hundred and thirty priests’ garments. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 71,
                    "num_str": "71",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And some of the heads of fathers’ houses gave into the treasury of the work twenty thousand darics of gold and two thousand two hundred minas of silver. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 72,
                    "num_str": "72",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And what the rest of the people gave was twenty thousand darics of gold, two thousand minas of silver, and sixty-seven priests’ garments."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 73,
                    "num_str": "73",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "So the priests, the Levites, the gatekeepers, the singers, some of the people, the temple servants, and all Israel, lived in their towns."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when the seventh month had come, the children of Israel were in their towns. "
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Ezra Summons the People to Obey the Law"
        }
    ]
}